.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt REPQUOTA 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm repquota
.Nd summarize the quotas of volumes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl g
.Op Fl u
.Op Fl v
.Fl a | Ar filesystem ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints a table of the users or groups in a volume's quota file: the
space used in 1K blocks and the files, each with its soft and hard limit
and, past the soft limit, the grace time left.
The two signs after a name are
.Ql +
when space or files are at or over the soft limit.
While quotas are on, the figures are the kernel's.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a
Every mounted local volume with quotas.
.It Fl g
Group quotas only.
.It Fl u
User quotas only.
.It Fl v
Also those that use nothing and have no limits.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr quota 1 ,
.Xr edquota 8 ,
.Xr quotacheck 8 ,
.Xr quotaon 8
.Sh HISTORY
Minkar's
.Nm
is its own.
